00:31:34.000 --> 00:32:11.000
We have so many wrong ideas about BPD and people with BPD that and to understand that all of us have bad self and interpersonal days. None of us can always be perfect in our management of interpersonal relationships. It's our biggest challenge every day. And yes, people will. with BPD or with personality disorder will have more occasions when they lose it with people, but we all can relate to that and to put that on the same dimension and to acknowledge the continuum between typical and atypical personality functioning is where we need to go.
我们对BPD和BPD患者有太多错误的观念，我们需要理解我们所有人都有自我和人际关系糟糕的日子。我们没有人能在处理人际关系时总是做到完美。这是我们每天面临的最大挑战。是的，患有BPD或人格障碍的人会有更多与人发生冲突的时刻，但我们都能感同身受。将这些放在同一个维度上，并承认典型与非典型人格功能之间的连续性，才是我们未来需要努力的方向。

