00:32:11.000 --> 00:32:59.000
So I think there's a lot of empirical research in support of these ideas. What we now need is the treatment research that shows that when we use the dimension to identify people into our randomized control trials for personality pathology treatment. We have the same effects as when we categorize people into BPD and we enroll them into our treatment trials. So I think the next big step for us is to do randomized controlled trials with alternative model defined personality disorder and not the old categories. That's definitely the biggest new challenge for us. Well, Dr. Sharp, this has been really interesting. I appreciate you're taking the time to talk to me today and to explain this really complicated disorder. Really, thank you so much.
所以我认为有很多实证研究支持这些观点。我们现在需要的是治疗研究，以证明当我们使用这一维度来筛选参与人格病理治疗随机对照试验的人员时，其效果与我们将人们归类为边缘性人格障碍（BPD）并将其纳入治疗试验的效果相同。因此，我认为我们下一步的重大举措是利用替代模型定义的人格障碍，而不是旧的分类方法来进行随机对照试验。这绝对是我们面临的最大新挑战。夏普博士，这次谈话非常有趣。感谢您抽出时间与我交谈，并解释这种非常复杂的疾病。真的非常感谢您。

